--! The platform the `browser/` corpus kind builds its programs for until
--! the real `browser` platform exists: a page program written with plain
--! `foreign` calls rather than markup, so the harness that loads a program
--! into a DOM, drives it and serialises what it rendered is proven before
--! any markup lowering targets a page.
--!
--! A view is a tree of `Node`s built by `element` and `text`. The runtime
--! renders it into `document.body`, patching the nodes it rendered last
--! time position by position, and a message is handled the way
--! `docs/design/backend.md` §15.11 specifies for `browser`: `update` runs at
--! once, and the render waits for one microtask flush.

--| What `main` is: a page program.
pub foreign type Program


--| A DOM node whose handlers produce messages of type `msg`.
pub foreign type Node msg


--| An attribute, a property or an event handler of an element.
pub foreign type Attribute msg


--| An element with its attributes and its children.
pub foreign pure element : String, List (Attribute msg), List (Node msg) → Node msg


--| A text node.
pub foreign pure text : String → Node msg


--| An attribute, written with `setAttribute`.
pub foreign pure attribute : String, String → Attribute msg


--| The live `value` of a form control, written as a property: what a
--| controlled input holds after every render.
pub foreign pure value : String → Attribute msg


--| Send `msg` when the element is clicked.
pub foreign pure onClick : msg → Attribute msg


--| Send the message made from the control's value on every `input` event.
pub foreign pure onInput : sync (String → msg) → Attribute msg


--| Send the message made from the key's name on every `keydown` event.
pub foreign pure onKeyDown : sync (String → msg) → Attribute msg


--| A page that renders `view` once and never changes.
pub foreign pure show : Node msg → Program


--| A page with a model: `init` is rendered first, and every message a
--| handler sends goes through `update` before the next render.
--| `update` and `view` are `sync`: neither may suspend.
pub foreign pure sandbox :
      { init : model, update : sync (msg, model → model), view : sync (model → Node msg) }
    → Program
